      "display": "Apple IIe video ROM",
      "description": "The character ROM of the (enhanced) Apple IIe (4 KB). It holds the shapes of the text and MouseText characters. Both IIe models and the TK3000 //e use it. It is Apple's and you have to supply it. AppleWin's source has it as resource/Apple2e_Enhanced_Video.rom.",
      "size": 4096,
      "sha1": "B2B5D87F52693817FC747DF087A4AA1DDCDB1F10",
      "name": "Apple2e_Enhanced_Video.rom",
      "requiredWhen": {
        "setting": "model",
        "in": [
